<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Calm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 12), Druid (guild level 26), Paladin (guild level 28)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast calm &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Soothes a frightened mind. It ends the fear spell on the target, and stops 
cause panic, so they no longer flee in terror. On someone who isn't afraid, 
nothing happens. It doesn't help against confusion.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Panic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>